<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Sales Opportunity Stage Closure Approval Required"
    recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__SalesOpportunityStage__c">
    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

        <html>

        <body>
        <div id="content"
            style="border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; background-color: #F8F8F8; width: 600px; margin: 10px;font-family:Sans-serif">
        <h3 style="padding: 30px 30px 30px 30px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: #810541; border-bottom-width: 1px; margin: 10px;">
           {!$ObjectType.SalesOpportunity__c.Label} {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.Name} requires approval before progressing to the next Sales Stage.
        </h3>
        <p style="padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px; margin: 10px;">
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td>{!$ObjectType.OpportunityStage__c.Fields.Name.Label}:</td>
                <td> 
                    <b>
                            <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.OpportunityStage__r.Name}"/>                          
                    </b>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__c.Label}:</td>
                <td> 
                    <b>
                            <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.ForecastStatus__r.Name}"/>                          
                    </b>
                </td>
            </tr>
             <tr>
                <td>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c.Label}:</td>
                 <td> 
                    <b>
                        <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}">
                            <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param>
                        </apex:outputText>
                    </b>
                </td>
            </tr>
             <tr>
                <td>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c.Label}:</td>
                 <td> 
                    <b>
                        <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}">
                            <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param>
                        </apex:outputText>
                    </b>
                </td>
            </tr>
            
        </table>    
        </p>


           
       



        <p style="padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px; margin: 10px;">You can
        approve or reject completion of this Sales Stage, by replying to this email and
        entering either <span style="color: #FF0000; font-weight: bold;">APPROVED</span>
        or <span style="color: #FF0000; font-weight: bold;">REJECTED</span> in
        the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you
        have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact our
        Operations Department on 0207-876 5432, or operations@kimbleapps.com.
        <br />
        <br />
        Regards <br />
        {!$Organization.Name} Operations Department<br />
        </p>

        </div>
        </body>
        </html>

    </messaging:htmlEmailBody>
    <messaging:plainTextEmailBody >
{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Label} {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.Name} requires approval before progressing to the next Sales Stage.

{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__OpportunityStage__c.Fields.Name.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.OpportunityStage__r.Name}" /> 
{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.ForecastStatus__r.Name}"/>                          
{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}">
                           <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param>
                                    <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param>
                        </apex:outputText>
{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SalesOpportunity__c.Fields.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c.Label}:<apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}">
                                    <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.SalesOpportunity__r.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param>
                        </apex:outputText>


You can approve or reject completion of this Sales Stage, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED 
or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries 
regarding this confirmation please contact our Operations Department on 0207-876 5432, or operations@kimbleapps.com. 

Regards {!$Organization.Name} 
Operations Department 

    </messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>